<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="28587134"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537515233"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="feel my soul"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YUI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="feel my soul"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:47.547"><div begin="00:04.953" end="03:19.850"><p begin="00:04.953" end="00:09.644" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">泣き疲れてたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经厌倦了哭泣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kiyoku ： YUI</span></p><p begin="00:09.644" end="00:14.404" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">問いかける場所もなく<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to i ka ke lu ba xiyo mo na ku</span></p><p begin="00:14.404" end="00:18.978" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">迷いながら つまずいても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算迷失也好 被绊倒也好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mayo i na ga la cu ma zu i te mo</span></p><p begin="00:18.978" end="00:24.621" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">立ち止まれない<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta qi do ma re na i</span></p><p begin="00:24.621" end="00:26.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">You're just believing</p><p begin="00:26.594" end="00:30.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">君がくれた笑顔<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你对我的笑容和那为我而哭的眼泪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kimi ga ku re ta e gao o to xi ta namida wa</span></p><p begin="00:30.623" end="00:37.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">落とした涙は 僕の胸の</p><p begin="00:37.427" end="00:45.019" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">深い傷に触れて消えた</p><p begin="00:45.019" end="00:50.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">I feel my soul, take me away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I feel my soul　Take me your way 那唯一的事情</span></p><p begin="00:50.801" end="00:57.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">そう たった一つを<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ta ta hi to cu wo</span></p><p begin="00:57.385" end="01:07.554" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">きっと誰もがずっと探しているの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个人一定都在一直找寻著</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki to dare mo ga zu to saga xi te i lu no</span></p><p begin="01:07.554" end="01:10.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">それは偶然ではなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这绝不是因为偶然</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re wa guu zen de wa na ku te</span></p><p begin="01:10.352" end="01:12.883" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">偽りの愛なんかじゃなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那份爱也不虚伪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">icuwa li no ai na n ka ji a na ku te</span></p><p begin="01:12.883" end="01:14.846" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">You're right, all right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直都是正确的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You're right all right</span></p><p begin="01:14.846" end="01:17.632" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">You're right, all right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直都是正确的 受惊吓的小男孩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You're right all right Scare little boy</span></p><p begin="01:17.574" end="01:19.904" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Scared little boy</p><p begin="01:23.939" end="01:27.663" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">何度も繰り返す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试过一次又一次 怎样也没法前进</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">nan do mo ku li kae su do u ka i ka na i de</span></p><p begin="01:27.663" end="01:32.748" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">どうか行かないで</p><p begin="01:32.748" end="01:43.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">囁くような君の声は愛しくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你那?柔对我细语的声音 令的一直爱恋著</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa sa ya ku yo u na kimi no koe wa ito xi ku te</span></p><p begin="01:43.336" end="01:48.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I feel my soul, take me away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉我的灵魂被你牵动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I feel my soul Take me your way</span></p><p begin="01:48.120" end="01:56.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">もう振り向かない きっと<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u fu li mu ka na i</span></p><p begin="01:56.258" end="02:05.093" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">この手で 今確かめたいよ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki to ko no te de i ma taxi ka me ta i yo</span></p><p begin="02:05.093" end="02:07.683" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">いつも単純なほど苦しんで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直置身在单纯的痛苦里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i cu mo tan jiyun na ho do kulu xi n de</span></p><p begin="02:07.683" end="02:10.446" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">生きていく意味を知りたいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想知道生存下去的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki te yu ku i mi wo xi li ta i ka la</span></p><p begin="02:10.446" end="02:12.721" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">You're right, all right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直都是正确的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You're right all right</span></p><p begin="02:12.721" end="02:15.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">You're right, all right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直都是正确的  受惊吓的小男孩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You're right all right Scare little boy</span></p><p begin="02:14.869" end="02:17.075" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Scared little boy</p><p begin="02:17.075" end="02:20.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">そっとつぶやいた君の言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那安抚我的温柔说话 you say it</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so to cu bu ya i ta kimi no koto ba you say it</span></p><p begin="02:20.906" end="02:24.459" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">You say it 動き出せ</p><p begin="02:24.343" end="02:31.599" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">見えないけど 道は開かれてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算我动不得也好 看不见也好 你都会为我开路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wugo ki da se mi e na i ke do miqi wa hila ka re te lu</span></p><p begin="02:35.047" end="02:40.318" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I feel my soul, take me away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉我的灵魂被你牵动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">I feel my soul Take me your way</span></p><p begin="02:40.318" end="02:48.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">そうもがきながらも きっと</p><p begin="02:48.654" end="02:56.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">このままずっと歩いて行ける</p><p begin="02:56.874" end="03:00.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">それは偶然でもなくって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这绝不是因为偶然</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re wa guu zen de mo na ku te</span></p><p begin="03:00.055" end="03:02.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">ありふれた夢なんかじゃなくって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那份爱也绝不是虚伪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a li fu re ta yume na n ka ji a na ku te</span></p><p begin="03:02.458" end="03:04.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">You're right,  all right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直都是正确的 你一直都是正确的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You're right all right You're right all right</span></p><p begin="03:04.560" end="03:06.986" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">You're right,  all right<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You're right all right You're right all right</span></p><p begin="03:07.114" end="03:10.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">いつも単純なほど苦しんで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直置身在单纯的痛苦里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i cu mo tan jiyun na ho do kulu xi n de</span></p><p begin="03:10.191" end="03:12.989" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">喜びの意味を知りたいから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想知道生存下去的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yoloko bi no i mi wo xi li ta i ka la</span></p><p begin="03:12.989" end="03:15.229" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">You're right,  all right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直都是正确的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You're right all right</span></p><p begin="03:15.229" end="03:17.412" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">You're right,  all right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你一直都是正确的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You're right all right Scare little boy</span></p><p begin="03:17.598" end="03:19.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Scared little boy</p></div></body></tt>